  "implemented": [
    "Fixed source readers expose all eleven authoritative field tables only to the separate crest_export role, with no direct table grants or ordinary web/worker/recovery access",
    "One owned RR READ ONLY transaction captures field context/pages and the complete included business operation/audit history; 20-row/4MiB pages, explicit count/byte/deadline limits, no silent truncation, no cross-snapshot page mixing or automatic retry",
    "Static reviewed164-column dictionary retains UUIDs, signed64 integers, four/eight-decimal distances/fractions and UTC microseconds as strings; JSONB arrives as original SQL JSON text rather than JavaScript Number",
    "Independent supplied-source checks verify internal FK tuples, replacement chains/current operator occupancy, mileage allocation/confirmation boundaries and one-to-one retained source/audit before-after images; parent-domain and actor/configuration closure remain explicit external dependencies",
    "Eleven normalized field CSV tables, existing exact operation/audit CSV/dictionaries/escape maps, structured source JSON and checksummed manifest preserve SQL NULL, literal backslashes, Unicode/newlines, formula-leading text and numeric scale",
    "Actual reimport into an empty neutral PostgreSQL database reproduces all164 field columns byte-exact in SQL row representations; a protected format fixture proves exact9007199254740993 and long decimal JSON values survive",
    "A real trip committed during capture is absent from the held snapshot/history and present in the next capture; standalone trips with no job and all earlier interval/trip/mileage versions remain included",
    "Changed source values/JSON rounding/missing versions/foreign internal keys/tampered history, invalid groups/tokens/page sizes, unsafe grants/unknown finance schema and cancellation before/after BEGIN fail closed with owned transaction rollback",
    "The closed integrity role gains only command-namespace usage and execution of the existing read-only history context needed for composition; no ordinary grant, schema CREATE, inheritance or permission bypass"
